OL,3,GNEWSATrain sped up past red signal
OL,4,Abefore fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train involved in a fatal crash had
OL,7,Faccelerated past a red signal that was
OL,8,Frarely ever on, investigators have
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FTrain driver Shaun Burton, 60, died and
OL,12,Fmore than 160 people were injured when
OL,13,Fhis London-bound service crashed into
OL,14,Fthe back of another train on 19 June at
OL,15,FElstow, near Bedford.
OL,17,FThe Rail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,18,F(RAIB) has found the signal had not
OL,19,Fdisplayed a red light to any train
OL,20,Fbefore the crash during 2026.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
