OL,3,GNEWSATrain sped up past red signal
OL,4,Abefore fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest interim report said CCTV had
OL,7,Fshown the signal had displayed red
OL,8,Fcorrectly, and Burton had acknowledged
OL,9,Fit, but he had continued to accelerate
OL,10,Fand applied brakes only seconds before
OL,11,Fhitting the other train, which had
OL,12,Fearlier come to a stop.
